704 0 obj
<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 278 0 R /Rect [ 56.697006 703.646945 538.617004 745.646945 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure6) /TU (Flowchart illustrating a diagnostic process using AI models. It starts with patient data including text descriptions and optional image paths. The text is processed by multiple large language models \(gpt-3.5, gpt-4, cohere\) providing probabilistic disease predictions. Images are analyzed by an image model \(ResNet18\). Outputs are merged in a fusion module, generating a combined probability distribution for a final diagnosis across five diseases.) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
705 0 obj
<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 278 0 R /Rect [ 56.697006 522.413974 538.617004 632.093966 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure7) /TU (Flowchart illustrating a process for collecting patient information via a public API. Key steps include parsing patient descriptions using GPT-4, standardizing terms with scispaCy and UMLS, inserting or merging records in MongoDB, handling file paths to extract image or PDF text insights, and storing results in GridFS. The process ends with returning structured data in JSON format.) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
